      "Description": "Adds a Profile to the Alignment\n\nAlignmentExtensions.AddProfileBySurface (alignment: Alignment, profileName: string, surface: string, layer: string, style: string, labelSet: string, offset: double, sampleStart: double, sampleEnd: double): Profile"
